        ],
        "abstract": "<jats:p>Maple Learn is one of Maplesoft’s educational products. Here, I discuss my use of it in online mathematics tutoring. I share my tutoring setup, compare it with other possible setups, and discuss the pros and cons of Maple Learn for tutoring. I conclude that Maple Learn allows tutors to write and format math easily while talking to students, unlike other products. It does not allow multiple users to work on the same document simultaneously. Overall, I recommend the product to tutors.</jats:p>",
